{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：14:07 2026-08-28 HKT</p>\n\n<p>47歲TVB節目主持「6號」陸浩明今日（28日）無預警宣布與模特兒女友陳詩欣（Ayan）結婚，結束14年愛情長跑。陸浩明貼出多張馬爾代夫求婚的照片並說：「Yeah！ 我求婚成功。<br/>我會用一萬倍嘅努力，讓妳幸福快樂。求婚時聽到你天使般嘅笑聲令我最甜蜜感動，以後嘅日子，你會成為我最幸福嘅家人，遇上妳係我一生最大嘅禮物，Love You 小公主！」</p>\n<h2>陸浩明陳詩欣相戀多年恩愛如昔</h2>\n<p>陸浩明和陳詩欣自2012年相戀，至今依然恩愛如昔，經常在社交平台上大放閃光彈，陸浩明曾透露二人在朋友聚會認識，當時覺得 陳詩欣身形高䠷像個模特兒，但開口說話的聲音卻像卡通人物般可愛，這種強烈反差讓他一見鍾情，遂以「自拍並傳送照片」為由成功交換聯絡方式，展開追求，兩人拍拖多年不時被催婚，陸浩明曾稱一直有結婚計劃，只是希望能夠先買樓「上車」提供另一半更穩定的優質生活。</p>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明與圈外女友陳詩欣拍拖14年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/84b978ffe14fc75d3bf62a7be22f79a6/2022-11/unknown_278960136_332390412322633_7641291988595567788_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明（6號）與網紅女友陳詩欣（Ayan）好恩愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cf54b4584bd54dba461f9c544dccf5ab/2024-09/ayanbubi_1671856853_3000075184123450193_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣在IG上大派粉絲福利。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/326e804c205340cbc70edad53b65a382/2024-09/Photo_by_on_September_15_2024_May_be_an_image_of_1_person_and_bra_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明與女友陳詩欣沙灘漫步，充滿粉紅色泡泡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3c9cc142947ab881f6a13c2c8301c65f/2024-09/Photo_shared_by_on_September_14_2024_tagging_lukhoo_and_ay6style_May_be_an_image_of_2_people_sundress_beach_twilight_and_ocean_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明無預警宣佈結婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ded685b08173d0bd3674d7c4d1b1c178/2026-08/lukhoo_2026_8_28_3973455676189246316_708533.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"結束14年長跑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eb6fe84570a2e57c17f01aa4ee20ee0d/2026-08/lukhoo_2026_8_28_3973455710330847683_708533.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明貼出多張馬爾代夫求婚的照片並說：「Yeah！ 我求婚成功。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e425acbed7efcd29b2215595b297c659/2026-08/lukhoo_2026_8_28_3973455725313024787_708533.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣晒婚戒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ff116cf327a3847ea16ab25f6ce2b28b/2026-08/lukhoo_2026_8_28_3973455744472590899_708533.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明和女友去馬爾代夫旅行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f491dfad13d444a8e9e93155d63155e4/2026-08/lukhoo_2026_8_28_3973455749757394679_708533.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明說：「 我會用一萬倍嘅努力，讓妳幸福快樂。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9dffa535175bcbe4c059b6b23a658e79/2026-08/lukhoo_2026_8_28_3973455770972247298_708533.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣心情勁靚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5fdb9ed058b0421204ff6798843834c1/2026-08/lukhoo_2026_8_28_3973455812403545698_708533.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明與陳詩欣的求婚儀式很浪漫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9e3e15cc28ad8429b5038927d542121d/2026-08/A1_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明早有準備。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d10c113018f835821df24d2cd1f27d03/2026-08/a2_0_33.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明與陳詩欣結束愛情長跑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7f850d00aea44183511dbebd25dc6bfb/2026-08/a3_56.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明與陳詩欣愛得甜蜜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a55a87ec0dc478e92f70b590e32ec168/2026-08/a4_39.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明拎出戒指。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3516079ea8901028a049b810e8fe0cd2/2026-08/a5_0_6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明準備求婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a035864dd0a88447910b06a9ba469ba1/2026-08/a6_0_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明單腳跪地。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/015b19d504efb6c83d6c79f78a5ffc59/2026-08/a7_0_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣很感動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8ad17c53ff1c21facd83eddb39cbee2b/2026-08/a8_0_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明問陳詩欣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4218e101f741249f20e3761a9405605c/2026-08/a9_0_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣點頭答允。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8e6a45a7bf04b8fccfbb98c662193096/2026-08/a10_0_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明為陳詩欣戴婚戒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cd5a63b600b340b2b06c2c35f923aaa0/2026-08/a11_0_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明與陳詩欣咀嘴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/537f1f78548718522aa98579bbca2ffb/2026-08/a12.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明與陳詩欣派心心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b5bee1313b1114fe0b44076878975d61/2026-08/a13.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣露出甜美笑容。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/964a7dbcbdf27e53921021e241ecb6c9/2026-08/a14.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明與陳詩欣出動航拍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/540a1ce304a7e003f15316bac9c3189a/2026-08/a15.jpg\"/>\n<h2>陸浩明與陳詩欣公認甜蜜的一對</h2>\n<p>陸浩明與陳詩欣雖然年齡相差十四年，但在娛樂圈中公認甜蜜的一對。兩人曾於TVB節目《1+1幸福》中分享相識經過與生活點滴，當時連節目主持汪明姐都催促他倆早日結婚，陳詩欣曾稱男友非常緊張與關心自己，她試過因朋友聚會忽略了他的訊息而令他非常著緊，但1她不單沒有感到厭煩，反而喜歡這種備受重視的感覺。陳詩欣又指男朋友脾氣好，對她十分遷就，評分的話有95分。陸浩明則表示每天最開心的事就是看見女朋友笑，煩惱便會一掃而空。</p>\n<h2>陸浩明是圈中公認的「寵妻狂魔」</h2>\n<p>陸浩明是圈中公認的「寵妻狂魔」，他曾透露願意資助女友 10 萬港元到法國藍帶廚藝學院修讀甜品課程以圓夢，私底下也曾大方贈送價值近十萬的名牌手袋給女友，更曾為女朋友準備了一套香港小姐的玩具后冠及權杖，並指若自己是香港小姐的評審，陳詩欣一定是冠軍。對於遲遲未有求婚，陸浩明坦言待儲夠老婆本買樓「上車」，提供另一半更穩定的優質生活，因此一直在努力儲老婆本，女友陳詩欣也非常體諒，從未因此抱怨。</p>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明與陳詩欣拍拖多年依然好恩愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/18f1dd870bd0077056092ae6c41b65a9/2023-12/ayanbubi_1650978490_2824934788096691569_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明女友陳詩欣不時派福利照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a47550df952759a32ac3b11583966f1b/2023-12/ayanbubi_1682601302_3090206156763980965_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明女友陳詩欣同時亦是一名KOL。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/372f30b611fd50d8be8e12456a0473cc/2023-12/ayanbubi_1682601302_3090206156772393542_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明女友陳詩欣常晒身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/80aa4ccd22941036635ca7783c40f3de/2023-12/ayanbubi_1682601302_3090206156772562092_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明女友陳詩欣外形不輸明星。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dd81da9672d0ba4e04507b5fec99af88/2023-12/ayanbubi_1682601302_3090206156831166103_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明女友陳詩欣常晒身材吸Like。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/326c40bb6387911eb3daaaed83031641/2023-12/ayanbubi_1682601302_3090206156847934510_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明女友陳詩欣樣子甜美。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a3c26f4bce25493b41d7da0d17190aa9/2023-12/ayanbubi_1682945619_3093094498144885192_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明和女友陳詩欣屢傳婚訊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cc611acafa570b2b284547b4dd108095/2023-12/ayanbubi_1682945619_3093094498144969906_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明女友陳詩欣愛晒泳照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/789e3af8fc9a86dd447c6c9f9d5e22be/2023-12/ayanbubi_1682945619_3093094498153480753_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明女友陳詩欣愛晒泳照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5186303310ed11a04281a83ee62f71a5/2023-12/ayanbubi_1685441989_3114035569821686382_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明女友陳詩欣愛晒泳照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3b10447629598a03b8ffc15e064dcb5a/2023-12/ayanbubi_1685441989_3114035569821711533_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明女友陳詩欣愛晒泳照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/74b4e24c886865b9d181a0fb8beb0f3c/2023-12/ayanbubi_1685441989_3114035569830002522_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明女友陳詩欣愛晒泳照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4f07c8a2a087fa14b0a615e914e51988/2023-12/ayanbubi_1685441989_3114035569939014748_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"外遊必穿三點式。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ee3175bfb71fd14ed697ab876eb25f7a/2023-12/ayanbubi_1696426859_3206183339717743499_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"外遊必穿三點式。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0324f23e037ecfbef67951f58541cf6c/2023-12/ayanbubi_1696426859_3206183339726095951_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"外遊必穿三點式。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f41ad6f9313290c5638ac997e9880e26/2023-12/ayanbubi_1696426859_3206183339726143549_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣經常PO靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f08b56b9edadae2962a577bd6650c655/2024-09/Photo_by_on_August_31_2024_May_be_an_image_of_2_people_and_Victoria_Peak__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣同陸浩明好sweet。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4427a608504feff608107624a1b943fa/2024-09/Photo_shared_by_6_on_September_12_2024_tagging_ayanbubi_and_ay6style_May_be_an_image_of_2_people_people_kissing_and_text__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣上圍好澎湃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/238f77e416566628f3b9a8e65aca4931/2024-09/_______d_skinsolutionscenter____C_HA_Bling_Pump_Ball____Cup____________0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣好多水著相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7685baf995d126675b968da2be7d4f75/2024-09/Photo_by_on_September_13_2024_May_be_an_image_of_1_person_hair_bra_pool_and_outdoors__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣陸浩明近日飛墾丁。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aef61387a778f8d1f129357f8d679cef/2024-09/________0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"二人感情好好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d754ad48d2fe5e9e224ec962eda31349/2024-09/Happy_Anniversary___________cityofdreamsmacau___royalcaviarclub_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣經常周圍影靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/047f80653fc9ea42a6733435ed127f5e/2024-09/Photo_by_in_O_a_Santorini_Greece__0.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-28T09:01:31.307986+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":828,"images":49,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}